lemma CorsV (a:f≤ s)(b:s ≤ r)(t:r ≤ n): ∀ (x:FrameK E), q s*LoomK x +‖AcJ p r s b x‖ ≤ d*q r*LoomK (PlcJ r s p b x):=by -- invert unit independent infrared.
 induction b with
 | refl=> intro x; rw[Ac_self,Plc_self,LinearMap.zero_apply,norm_zero,add_zero,LinearMap.id_apply]; apply mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right _ (noLoom _); exact le_mul_of_one_le_left (Q.hot a t).le Q.down
 | @step j h ih=>
    obtain ⟨Z,U,V,e⟩:= pu.turn j (a.trans h) t; have ht:= ih (Nat.le_trans (Nat.le_succ _) t); intro x; let i':= PlcJ j s p h x; let k':= p.C j i' -- macro Binder.P.Warning.
    rw [Ac_step p j s h, Plc_succ _ _ _ h, LinearMap.add_apply,LinearMap.comp_apply,LinearMap.comp_apply]
    let B:= LoomK i'; let u:= LoomK k'; have hx:=V i'; have hp:=Q.pass (a.trans h) t; let q':= q (j+1); have hr:0 ≤ d:=zero_le_one.trans Q.down; let W':= d+χ; have hw: 0≤ W':= add_nonneg hr Q.κPrice; have he:W'*(q j)*B ≤d*q'*u:=by
       refine (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hx (mul_nonneg hw (Q.hot (a.trans h) (by omega)).le)).trans ?_; rw [←mul_assoc _ I₀]; apply mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right _ (noLoom _); refine (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hp.2 hw) Q.invCost).trans ?_
       exact (le_trans (b:=2*W'*I₀*q') (le_of_eq (by unfold q'; ring)) (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right Q.theme (Q.hot ((a.trans h).trans (by omega)) t).le))
    calc
      _≤q s*LoomK x+(‖AcJ p j s h x‖+χ*q j* B):= add_le_add_right ((norm_add_le ..).trans (add_le_add_right (e i') _)) _
      _≤ W'*q j* B:=by dsimp only [W']; linarith only [ht x]
      _≤ _:=he
